### 592-category-rename.http — issue #592
### CASE-05. (Category) 카테고리 이름을 수정할 수 있다

### 1. 관리자 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@earlybird.co.kr",
  "password": "rawPassword3!"
}

> {%
    client.test("관리자 로그인 성공", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
    client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 2. 카테고리 A 등록 (parent 없음)
< {% client.global.set("catAName", "usecase592-A-" + Date.now()); %}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "{{catAName}}" }

> {%
    client.test("A 등록 성공", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
    client.global.set("categoryAId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. A의 이름만 변경 (parentProjectCategoryId 는 기존 값 null 유지)
< {% client.global.set("catANewName", "usecase592-A-renamed-" + Date.now()); %}
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories/{{categoryAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "{{catANewName}}", "parentProjectCategoryId": null }

> {%
    client.test("이름 변경 반영", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "update failed: " + response.body);
        client.assert(response.body.data.name === client.global.get("catANewName"), "name not updated");
    });
%}
